<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-SOUTH AMERICAN SUPERCUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SOUTH AMERICAN SUPERCUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of South American</p>
<p>Supercup matches played Thursday:</p>
<p>First round, second leg</p>
<p>In Sao Paulo: Sao Paulo (Brazil) 2 Olimpia (Paraguay) 1</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Sao Paulo - Victor Hugo Aristizabal (48th minute), Serginho</p>
<p>(86th)</p>
<p>Olimpia - Adriano Samaniego (88th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,000</p>
<p>Aggregate score 3-3. Olimpia win 5-3 on penalties.</p>
<p>In Buenos Aires: Racing Club (Argentina) 0 Argentinos</p>
<p>Juniors (Argentina) 0.</p>
<p>Note: Racing and Argentinos are in a three-team group that</p>
<p>also includes Boca Juniors (Argentina). All other first round</p>
<p>ties feature two teams playing on a home-and-away basis.</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> Racing Club	   3  1  2  0  3  1  5</p>
<p> Boca Juniors	  2  1  1  0  2  0  4</p>
<p>Argentinos Juniors  3  0  1  2  0  4  1</p>
</text>
